OL,5,G0900 The Saturday Show
OL,6,     FLive from Boston, Amy Irons and
OL,7,     FSteven Mill soak up the atmosphere
OL,8,     Fand take you into the heart of the
OL,9,     Faction as they discuss Scotland's
OL,10,     FWorld Cup clash with Morocco.
OL,11,G1200 Off the Ball
OL,12,     FThe most petty and ill-informed
OL,13,     Ffootball show on radio.
OL,14,G1400 Sportsound
OL,15,     FWe're live from Boston as
OL,16,     FScotland's World Cup campaign
OL,17,     Fcontinues, plus all of the latest
OL,18,     FScottish football news.
